  noteTitle: Father Mateo's Final Prayer
  noteContent: "If you found this, then the sacred items are together again.\r\n\rPlace
    the two candles, the Bible, and the cross where they belong inside the church.\r\n\rThese
    holy items can weaken Varen, but they cannot seal him here.\n\n\r\n\rAfter placing
    them, go to the heart of Malawak Forest.\r\n\rFind the ritual tree and pray there.\r\n\rOnly
    the final prayer at the tree can complete the sealing and stop Varen."
  readRange: 2
  readKey: 101
