  noteContent: "Jude was right. Father Mateo is possessed.\r\n\rThe thing inside
    him is called Varen.\r\n\rWe tried to stop the ritual, but Varen killed Father
    Mateo and everyone inside the church. Jude and I escaped, but it is still hunting
    us.\n\r\n\rI kept the church key, the cross, and one sacred candle inside this
    house.\r\n\rThe Bible was left inside the church.\r\n\rTake these items and go
    to the church. Find the Bible and the second candle before Varen finds you."
  readRange: 2
  readKey: 101
